  <!-- EN: Platebreaker -->
  <OMG_Trophy_Knife.label>破甲刃</OMG_Trophy_Knife.label>
  <!-- EN: Forged with the sole purpose of piercing through armor, Platebreaker is a weapon of war, able to exploit the weakest points in any protection. The dagger’s precision and strength make it lethal in the hands of a skilled warrior.\n\nSpecially modified weapon charged with Necrobane, Stun and EMP damages.\n\nThis modification deprives item's quality levels. -->
  <OMG_Trophy_Knife.description>专门为了穿透护甲而锻造，破甲刃是一种战争武器，能够利用任何防护装备的最薄弱点。这把匕首的精确性和力量使其在熟练战士手中致命。\n\n经过特殊改装的武器，带有死灵克星、眩晕和EMP伤害。\n\n此改装剥夺了物品的品质等级。</OMG_Trophy_Knife.description>
  <!-- EN: handle -->
  <OMG_Trophy_Knife.tools.handle.label>握把</OMG_Trophy_Knife.tools.handle.label>
  <!-- EN: blade -->
  <OMG_Trophy_Knife.tools.blade.label>刀刃</OMG_Trophy_Knife.tools.blade.label>
  <!-- EN: point -->
  <OMG_Trophy_Knife.tools.point.label>刀尖</OMG_Trophy_Knife.tools.point.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Neon Echo -->
  <OMG_Trophy_PowerGuitar.label>霓虹回声</OMG_Trophy_PowerGuitar.label>
  <!-- EN: This cyber-guitar of unknown origin is surrounded by rumors, passed from one owner to the next. According to legends, it once had a life of its own and now carries a strange, haunting resonance.\n\nSpecially modified weapon charged with Necrobane, Stun and EMP damages.\n\nThis modification deprives item's quality levels. -->
  <OMG_Trophy_PowerGuitar.description>这把来源不明的赛博吉他被传言包围，从一个主人传到另一个主人。根据传说，它曾经拥有自己的生命，现在带着一种奇怪而令人难忘的共鸣。\n\n经过特殊改装的武器，带有死灵克星、眩晕和EMP伤害。\n\n此改装剥夺了物品的品质等级。</OMG_Trophy_PowerGuitar.description>
